{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Ronin of the Spirit Realm, embark on a path of redemption as your hack-n-slash your way through the evil brewing in the Outer Realm. Stop the ominous Overlords in their tracks, but tread lightly, for every corner hosts clever tricksters, colossal beasts, and tyrannical kings to challenge your resolve. Cut-down the formidable and loot powerful equipment, changing the pace of your next duel!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massively Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with new or existing friends in the open realms. Work in tandem to slay the mightiest of foes thought impossible alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/b320ad1b13cef885f713f789ac1d8157.poster.avif?t=1767903356\" width=220 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/b320ad1b13cef885f713f789ac1d8157.webm?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/b320ad1b13cef885f713f789ac1d8157.mp4?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of permanent death, where each step forward is earned, however, not all is dreadful. The Honor of your past lives will build your next journey, creating a dynasty of tremendous Ronin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/613172961225c8155485b17be789fa15.poster.avif?t=1767903356\" width=214 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/613172961225c8155485b17be789fa15.webm?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/613172961225c8155485b17be789fa15.mp4?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Look</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your achievements through your worn equipment! Each weapon and piece of armor changes the look of your Ronin along with collectible hats and pet companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/ba6a7ddaf45a12af83d82c4d9f85b6c0.poster.avif?t=1767903356\" width=218 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/ba6a7ddaf45a12af83d82c4d9f85b6c0.webm?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/extras/ba6a7ddaf45a12af83d82c4d9f85b6c0.mp4?t=1767903356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix up your class, equipment, and blessings to create wild and fun combinations. Be a stealthy assassin striking from the dark, a barbaric warrior hacking their way through the horde, or a precise archer supporting from afar!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2332210?t=1767903356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2332210?t=1767903356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/a4a00f8e274b22ebdbb5c90881c371b581bd4835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767903356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332210/a4a00f8e274b22ebdbb5c90881c371b581bd4835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767903356","categories":[{"description":